  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "During the second fight with Hei Cheng inside pear orchard, after earth flower lotus burial has swallowed one dark arrow, Fairy Li Shan calls this killer move while pale from exertion. Hei Cheng fuses his two leftover dark arrows midair into one darker shaft that stabs a huge pear trunk; from the far side she springs tree flower sheds tears, and nectar seals the arrow in amber around a wooden puppet bait.",
