    {
      "text": "Pear orchard, earth flower lotus burial, fading heavenly flower, and tree flower sheds tears are all mortal killer moves. She devised three flower moves carefully to temporarily seal dark arrow Immortal Gu; the set drains her mind, and those three flower methods rely on the pear orchard battlefield, so if that field falls they weaken greatly and the sealed arrows can escape.",
